Z||000009||FieroMike||05-15-99||10:12 AM||||Just to put in my .02, I say that a really good running motor and a good driver can get under 15.0 with just a filter. I have seen plenty of cars do that at Bandimere. (Denver)<br>Unfortunately I haven't got to race mine yet, but I will soon!  p.s. The new Honda Civic SI ('99) Has a 4-banger and they can pull mid 15's and in a street race I have them by 3 car lengths by 80-90 MPH.  Although I would say %70 of us couldn't do it stock. Later!
